  "text": "RESOLUTION NO 6 (Series 2025)\nA RESOLUTION OF THE BOARD OF SELECTMEN FOR THE TOWN OF GEORGETOWN,\nCOLORADO THAT SETS FEES FOR THE NATURAL MEDICINE LICENSING\nWHEREAS, the Town of Georgetown maintains a list of fees charged by the Town for various\nreasons, and\nWHEREAS, the Town of Georgetown recently established a new license category for\nproviders of Natural Medicine as defined in Colorado law, and\nWHEREAS, in establishing the license category, the Board of Selectmen needs to set the\nfees for the license categories,\nNOW,THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED, by the Board of Selectmen of the Town of\nGeorgetown, Colorado that the following fees are set for the listed categories of license for\nnatural medicine businesses:\nApplication for New License:\nLicense Fee:\n$1,000.00\n75.00\nRenewal Fee:\n100.00\nAND BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED that the above fees be effective immediately.\nADOPTED, this 25t day of February, 2025 at a regularly scheduled meeting of the Board of\nSelectmen.\nRESOLVED, APPROVED and ADOPTED this 25th day of February, 2025.\nTOWN OF GEORGETOWN\nBx chamlskr\nLynette Kelsey, Police Judge\nATTEST:\nBrigitte Korte, Town Clerk",
  "text_sha256": "ce3e2430c16b1924bab5eec7d42ccdec678f5258077a377388afc2483975ccfc",
